SECTION | KEY | VALUE
----------------------------------------
# keybinds.pdl - rpg-pet INT keys. SAME codes as @.apps/pet-trainer/keybinds.pdl (and piececraft-hq): in interact mode the khtpm window appends "<code> <ms>" lines to state/interact_relay.txt;
# arrows arrive as 1000 left, 1001 right, 1002 up, 1003 down (NOT the 200-203 band of the agent relay file), Esc and Enter go to state/keyboard/history.txt.
KEY | arrow_left  | 1000
KEY | arrow_right | 1001
KEY | arrow_up    | 1002
KEY | arrow_down  | 1003
KEY | control_switch | 9      # Tab: INT drives the selected pet <-> the player
KEY | render_mode_toggle | 48 # 0
KEY | pov_mode_1 | 49
KEY | pov_mode_4 | 52
KEY | escape | 27
